Sharpened repro of cpp17_hash_node_vector_alloc's residual: a bare
std::unordered_set<K>* declaration (no object) is enough to make the
later std::vector<K>::push_back body get dropped through a silent
enable_if<0,void> SFINAE throw on _S_use_relocate.

FIXED 2026-07-18: convert_template_parameter's by-short-name fallback
captured an enclosing instantiation's same-named parameter for an
explicitly-unassigned deduction variable ([temp.deduct]/2 clean slate);
now restricted to identifiers wholly unknown to the template map.
